# The warehouse is 74 MB. It travels in the published npm tarball, not in git -- a repo that
# carries it makes every clone pay for it forever, and git has no way to forget a blob once
# it is in history. Build it with the ingest in the cricket-chat repo, or fetch a published
# tarball and take `data/cricket.duckdb` out of it.
data/*.duckdb
data/*.duckdb.wal

.env
.DS_Store
